cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Jev-Interaction in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Jev-Interaction: full-duplex voice turn-taking as plain-language decisions"
abstract: >-
  A full-duplex voice framework whose turn-taking is a set of plain-language
  decisions (turn, listen, floor, cut_in, quiet, who) judged by Jev, not a
  trained model. Policies turn the judge's probabilities into actions, and
  paces blend the timings.
authors:
